+### Compound output
+
+```ts
+ms(5400000, { compound: true })        // "1h 30m"
+ms(-5400000, { compound: true })       // "-1h 30m"
+```
+
+Largest unit first, zero parts skipped, leftover milliseconds dropped (so values under one second give `"0s"`). Units range from days to seconds. `compound` takes precedence over `long`.
+
 ### Input Formats (Units)
 
